ITIES shall be maintained in good repair.","citation":"","citation_text":""}]},{"id":"376055","date":"2020-12-15","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":1,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8951&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=376055&INSPECTION_NN=376055","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":55,"title":"Physical facilities installed, maintained, and clean","repeat":false,"comment":"6-201.16: Observed caulking at the hand washing sink and the triple sink to be in need of repair. Ensure this seal is repaired to allow the surface to be smooth, non-absorbent, and easily cleanable.\n6-201.16: (A) Wall and ceiling covering materials shall be attached so that they are EASILY CLEANABLE. (B) Except in areas used only for dry storage, concrete, porous blocks, or bricks used for indoor wall construction shall be finished and SEALED to provide a SMOOTH, nonabsorbent, EASILY CLEANABLE surface.","citation":"","citation_text":""}]},{"id":"370369","date":"2020-09-04","visit":"Spot check","type_raw":"Spot Check","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8951&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=370369&INSPECTION_NN=370369","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"355006","date":"2020-01-27","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8951&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=355006&INSPECTION_NN=355006","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"332567","date":"2019-05-17","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABL